    "$t": "阮兜"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>鄭秀女</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnbNNG9vK9c3rxgLl4GzLjXTmGTsK_Icb3DfPy5iP-ZfdZofsl6sGu5FagLJtMFwmOvj-o1GF7JXZLapo-0_Yv8f-rjoFvON2gOh5RTEr3y-60gDnH1eMPC6dWa-g-RwwKXf2MNizbXx5l1z3wSSuesbKw9FiW4LDnnjIf6D6GPF0RRABurUk1pFrcFnW2/s6240/%E3%80%88%E9%98%AE%E5%85%9C%E3%80%89%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%8701.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"4160\" data-original-width=\"6240\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnbNNG9vK9c3rxgLl4GzLjXTmGTsK_Icb3DfPy5iP-ZfdZofsl6sGu5FagLJtMFwmOvj-o1GF7JXZLapo-0_Yv8f-rjoFvON2gOh5RTEr3y-60gDnH1eMPC6dWa-g-RwwKXf2MNizbXx5l1z3wSSuesbKw9FiW4LDnnjIf6D6GPF0RRABurUk1pFrcFnW2/w640-h426/%E3%80%88%E9%98%AE%E5%85%9C%E3%80%89%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%8701.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Tuì國中hit條路直直行--落-去，順路彎過去看著紅牆仔門，he就是阮兜。」若有人beh來阮兜，阮lóng是án-ne kā報路。阮兜自阮阿爸in兄弟仔隨人食就一直蹛tī tsia。Tsit間厝是阮阿爸阿母in兩个家己起--ê，拄開始是一間平階。阿爸阿母做khang-khuè規工無閒tshih-tshih，驚囡仔tsông出去軍路，就做鐵圍kā規間厝圍--起-來；tsit个鐵圍m̄是規phiàn--ê，是一枝一枝ê鐵枝kap áu出花草ê鐵仔組--起-來--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">厝ê倒手爿有一个埕，埕內底是種kah滿sì-kè ê植物，種--ê m̄是hōo人看suí ê花，種--ê lóng是ē食--得--ê，親像菜瓜、木瓜、檨仔iáu-koh有一欉龍眼樹。菜瓜棚kā規个埕lóng tsa̍h--leh，阮有thang食koh ē-tàng nah涼，有影是「一兼二顧，摸lâ仔兼洗褲」，有食koh有掠。落尾因為見擺若落雨，規个埕就tâm-kôo-kôo，致使厝內mā溼溼無清氣，阿爸tsiah kā埕用紅毛塗thūn平。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit个埕是阮tsit群囡仔ê遊戲場，阮tī tsia sńg ng-ko̍k雞、扮公家伙仔、跳格仔厝、掠包仔、跳索仔、占土地等濟濟ê tshit-thô路。Tī學校sńg無夠，tńg來厝koh招厝邊隔壁做伙sńg。埕mā是阮囡仔人ê動物園，田--裡釣ê四跤仔、水溝仔hôo--起-來ê孔雀魚、tī運動會ê販仔買--tńg-來ê鵪鶉、iáu有阿母飼ê雞仔等等，濟濟ê動物陪伴阮無電動ê囡仔生活。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熱天ê暗時，阿爸ē mooh一領蓆仔招阮去埕--裡iah是亭仔跤秋凊，阮tiānn-tiānn ē koo-tsiânn阿爸講古，pûn雞胿ê故事是一定有--ê，食tsínn薑ê虎姑婆mā tiānn講。有時仔阿爸興頭來koh ē叫阮排隊hōo伊ngiáu耳空屎。倒tī外口秋凊，tiānn-tiānn無細膩睏--去，阿爸就ē kā阮一个一个抱入去睏，有時陣阮mā ē假睏來騙阿爸。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">後--來阮愈來愈大漢，平階無夠thang蹛，阿爸阿母就kā厝翻做兩樓，in家己就是做塗水--ê，翁仔某勤儉，lóng是利用做工tńg--來、iah是歇睏日來起家己ê厝。Án-ne阮tsia-ê囡仔就是上好ê跤手，kā tàu-sann-kāng搬磚仔、洗thài-lù、khioh釘仔去賣，tuè大人leh無閒起阮家己ê厝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">翻新ê厝一樓無啥改變，kan-na大廳塗跤磨石仔，灶跤翻khah大間koh貼thài-lù，thài-lù ê圖樣有四片kap--起-來ê孔雀，一片一片ê花、草莓iah是厝角鳥仔，是一間tuè時行ê灶跤。Peh起去二樓，值得講--ê是廳--裡，塗跤貼花色ê thài-lù，磨石仔壁koh khai錢裝潢天篷，掛一kuānn siak-phānn ê水晶燈，kánn-ná城堡仝款，是阮少女時代做夢ê所在。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit時起好ê厝有kā原本tī廳--裡ê樓梯留--落-來，iáu有tī灶跤hia koh起一座樓梯，雙樓梯tsiânn做阮偷偷仔聽序大人講話ê祕密所在，阮koh bat bih hia偷看二姊相親ê對象。Tsit个滿足阮好玄心ê樓梯tī上尾一擺翻厝ê時khà--起-來，kā一樓一間閒間翻做客廳，客廳變兩倍大，koh kā生壁癌ê壁lóng貼thài-lù，天篷貼浮印ê壁紙，tsit間suí koh大pān ê客廳就一直用到tsit-má。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今年，tsit間老厝就beh行入去歷史--ah，阮小弟beh tī tsit个所在起一間新厝。人講「食果子拜樹頭，食米飯拜田頭」，阮一定ē kā你記tiâu-tiâu，bē放bē記--得。有你ê致蔭，tuì tsia飛--出-去ê鳥仔，翼股lóng生著真tīng-tauh，hōo阮有滿滿ê勇氣去hām外口ê大風大湧tshia拚。感謝你無私ê奉獻，tī阮ê心內你是阮永遠ê厝。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj5qD0QclpiABG84INNZyZtQXV-nv3BAIWrqq9qfiJVyu4KPT8Za82yhYKTxCs9c3-ySm6WR1EHq_E-tXv7mmL0jptC69Mzi75G2c_7cK1PXtE4sPipwuLwAKw9gejRunfdSI6abjxHXQMLlWiPPyWHL-0q_aI5J11Np8lxZ09ub0EBLx0Ms3R5f2DXCKz_/s5586/%E3%80%88%E9%98%AE%E5%85%9C%E3%80%89%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%8702.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3943\" data-original-width=\"5586\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj5qD0QclpiABG84INNZyZtQXV-nv3BAIWrqq9qfiJVyu4KPT8Za82yhYKTxCs9c3-ySm6WR1EHq_E-tXv7mmL0jptC69Mzi75G2c_7cK1PXtE4sPipwuLwAKw9gejRunfdSI6abjxHXQMLlWiPPyWHL-0q_aI5J11Np8lxZ09ub0EBLx0Ms3R5f2DXCKz_/w640-h452/%E3%80%88%E9%98%AE%E5%85%9C%E3%80%89%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%8702.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjVv5iETL1QsjFIquTcRcVOV-FE5kIlrmxKaFMT1BSrlsOlFPweDhijc7SRel8Tc0z72iAElztWNuUnY5LRKEpYeyRrHKjwKL3YKq-ftIgGXxuRH1jHsb6-6bTBOBTOvu_KkE72e8_tt1rExziEJFNguaJ-aJzAwJcaDHpyj9uyxZsyKGcUI-caNcfeGzUb/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjVv5iETL1QsjFIquTcRcVOV-FE5kIlrmxKaFMT1BSrlsOlFPweDhijc7SRel8Tc0z72iAElztWNuUnY5LRKEpYeyRrHKjwKL3YKq-ftIgGXxuRH1jHsb6-6bTBOBTOvu_KkE72e8_tt1rExziEJFN